    count: 4-5 bordered sprites, all same shape within example
    shape: 3x3 filled box (8 border + 1 center) or plus/cross (4 border + 1 center)
    colors: each has unique border_color and a center_color; all border_colors distinct
    placement: most at grid edges (may be clipped), 0-2 interior; no sprite overlap
